# Frontend

- Prefer Tailwind utility classes over one-off CSS files for app UI.
- Event handlers: `handleClick`, `handleKeyDown`, etc.
- Early returns over deep nesting.
- No `any` in TypeScript — use `unknown` and narrow.
- Accessibility: labels / `aria-label`, keyboard activation for custom controls, visible focus.
- One component library only (see `assets/reference/ui-design.md`).
- Const arrow functions for components/handlers when that matches the file's style.
